am | 96 credit points</p> <!-- --> <!-- --> <p> Bachelor of Business Commerce (Marketing) </p> <p>Van Lang University, Vietnam | 96 credit points</p> <!-- --> <!-- --> <p> Bachelor of Economics </p> <p>Central University of Finance and Economics, China | 108 credit points</p> <!-- --> <!-- --> <p> Bachelor of International Trade </p> <p>Henan University, China | 168 credit points</p> <!-- --> <!-- --> <p> Bachelor of Management Studies </p> <p>Vidyalankar School of Information Technology (VSIT), Indonesia, Indonesia | 96 credit points</p> <!-- --> <!-- --> <p> Diploma in Accounting and Finance </p> <p>Amity Global Institute, Singapore, Singapore | 96 credit points</p> <!-- --> <!-- --> <p> Diploma in Banking and Finance </p> <p>Amity Global Institute, Singapore, Singapore | 96 credit points</p> <!-- --> <!-- --> <p> Diploma in Business </p> <p>Prospects College of Higher Education, Sri Lanka, Sri Lanka | 96 credit points</p> <!-- --> <!-- --> <p> Diploma in Business Administration </p> <p>Amity Global Institute, Singapore, Singapore | 96 credit points</p> <!-- --> <!-- --> <p> Diploma in Business Administration </p> <p>Sunway College Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia | 96 credit points</p> <!-- --> <!-- --> <p> Diploma in Finance </p> <p>Sunway College Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia | 96 credit points</p> <!-- --> <!-- --> <p> Diploma in Health Care Management </p> <p>Sunway College Johor Bahru, Malaysia | 96 credit points</p> <!-- --> <!-- --> <p> Diploma in Hotel Management </p> <p>Sunway College Johor Bahru, Malaysia | 48 credit points</p> <!-- --> <!-- --> <p> Diploma in International Business </p> <p>Sunway College Johor Bahru, Malaysia | 96 credit points</p> <!-- --> <!-- --> <p> Diploma in International Hospitality and Tourism Management </p> <p>Amity Global Institute, Singapore, Singapore | 96 credit points</p> <!-- --> <!-- --> <p> Diploma in International Logistics and Supply Chain Management </p> <p>Amity Global Institute, Singapore, Singapore | 96 credit points</p> <!-- --> <!-- --> <p> Diploma of Business </p> <p>Blended Learning International (BLI), Australia, Australia | Guaranteed entry only</p> <!-- --> <!-- --> <p> Diploma of Business Management </p> <p>Amity Global Institute, Singapore, Singapore | 96 credit points</p> <!-- --> <!-- --> <p> Diploma of Marketing </p> <p>Sunway College Johor Bahru, Malaysia | 96 credit points</p> <!-- --> <!-- --> <p> Swinburne University Diploma of Business (UniLink) </p> <p>Nawaloka College of Higher Studies, Sri Lanka, Sri Lanka | Guaranteed entry only</p> <!-- --> <!-- --> <p> Year One of Bachelor of Business </p> <p>National School of Business Management, Colombo, Sri Lanka | 96 credit points</p> <!-- --> <!-- --> <p> Year One of Bachelor of Business (Banking and Finance/Financial Risk Management) </p> <p>National School of Business Management, Colombo, Sri Lanka | 96 credit points</p> <!-- --> <!-- --> <p> Year One of Bachelor of Business (Banking and Finance/Financial Risk Management) </p> <p>National School of Business Management, Colombo, Sri Lanka | 96 credit points</p> <br/><!-- --> <!-- --> <p>If you have completed study with another university or institution you may be eligible to receive <a href="https://www.vu.edu.au/study-at-vu/courses/credit-for-skills-past-study"><!-- -->credit for skills and past study<!-- --><!-- --></a>.</p> <p>Use our credit calculator to find out what credit you may be eligible for based on your previous studies.</p> <p>Note that if your previous study can’t be found through the credit calculator, you may still be eligible for credit. </p> <p>Units can be credited if they are part of the course structure for the course you are applying for. Please note that credits relating to prior VU subjects are automatically granted and no further action is required.</p> <p><a href="https://www.vu.edu.au/study-at-vu/courses/credit-for-skills-past-study/credit-calculator/#/home ">calculate your credit</a></p> <br/> <!-- --> <!-- --> <!-- --> <p><br/> Victoria University is committed to providing a transparent admissions process. Find out more about <a href="https://www.vu.edu.au/study-at-vu/how-to-apply"><!-- -->how to apply for our courses<!-- --><!-- --></a>, and our commitment to <a href="https://www.vu.edu.au/study-at-vu/how-to-apply/admissions-at-vu"><!-- -->admissions transparency<!-- --><!-- --></a>. Meeting the minimum admission criteria does not guarantee entry into this course. Past academic performance may be considered.</p> <!-- --> <!-- --> <!-- --> <!-- -->',
