eadership-sbol"><!-- -->Bachelor of Outdoor Leadership (SBOL)<!-- --><!-- --></a></td><td>50%</td></tr><tr><td><a href="/courses/bachelor-of-physical-education-and-sport-science-sbph"><!-- -->Bachelor of Physical Education and Sport Science (SBPH)<!-- --><!-- --></a></td><td>60%</td></tr><tr><td><a href="/courses/bachelor-of-exercise-and-sport-science-sbec"><!-- -->Bachelor of Exercise and Sport Science (SBEC)<!-- --><!-- --></a></td><td>60%</td></tr><tr><td><a href="/courses/bachelor-of-sport-science-human-movement-bachelor-of-psychological-studies-sbhp"><!-- -->Bachelor of Sport Science (Human Movement)/Bachelor of Psychological Studies (SBHP)<!-- --><!-- --></a></td><td>50%</td></tr><tr><td><a href="/courses/bachelor-of-sport-science-human-movement-bachelor-of-sport-management-sbhs"><!-- -->Bachelor of Sport Science (Human Movement)/Bachelor of Sport Management (SBHS)<!-- --><!-- --></a></td><td>50%</td></tr></tbody></table><p>To be eligible for the destination course, you must achieve the required weighted average mark (WAM) in your assessments. The WAM is a way of calculating your average academic performance, which includes the raw mark achieved and the credit point value of each unit.</p> <!-- --> <br/><!-- --> <!-- --> <table><thead><tr><th>Destination course</th><th>WAM % required to apply</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="/courses/bachelor-of-sport-management-sbsm"><!-- -->Bachelor of Sport Management (SBSM)<!-- --><!-- --></a></td><td>50%</td></tr><tr><td><a href="/courses/bachelor-of-sport-management-bachelor-of-business-sbsb"><!-- -->Bachelor of Sport Management/Bachelor of Business (SBSB)<!-- --><!-- --></a></td><td>50%</td></tr></tbody></table><p>To be eligible for the destination course, you must achieve the required weighted average mark (WAM) in your assessments. The WAM is a way of calculating your average academic performance, which includes the raw mark achieved and the credit point value of each unit.</p> <!-- --> <br/> <!-- --> <!-- -->